    <abstract>
        <para>Species records from Northern Ireland submitted to iNaturalist and identification confirmed at Research Grade level on iNaturalist licenced under CC0, CC-BY and CC-BY-NC.
Records where the location was blurred on iNaturalist or where the scientific name did not match with a name on the UK species inventory have been excluded.</para>
    </abstract>
